": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20351, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0126P5xYULpWWM5iQnAuYbmM", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25471, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LEkzFN46Ap6kRcdw6FURRz", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy (error rate 18%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release previously healthy in production. First rollback attempt partially failed: us-east rolled back, then the rollout halted on an orchestrator error, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1 (mixed state). A second rollback attempt completed successfully. Current state: all three regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate 0.2%. Follow-ups: (1) root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before any redeploy; (2) investigate the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback mid-rollout.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 56071, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LEkzFN46Ap6kRcdw6FURRz", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 56071, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LEkzFN46Ap6kRcdw6FURRz", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 58173, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01QSWKPCtBm1Xw1FuHN6VTjd", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 58473, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01QSWKPCtBm1Xw1FuHN6VTjd", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 58473, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QSWKPCtBm1Xw1FuHN6VTjd", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 64354, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The incident was created despite the timeout (INC-0001), so no retry was needed \u2014 that avoids paging on-call twice.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Rollback completed \u2014 checkout-api is healthy on v2.3.0 in all regions.**\n\n- **Diagnosis:** checkout-api was on v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west, and eu-west, unhealthy with an 18% error rate. Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy, so it was excluded).\n- **Rollback:** The first `rollback` to v2.3.0 partially failed \u2014 us-east rolled back, then the orchestrator errored and halted, leaving us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1. I retried the rollback, which completed successfully. Verified: all three regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** Opened **INC-0001 (SEV2)** for checkout-api describing the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current state, and two follow-ups: root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before redeploying, and investigate the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback. The create call timed out, but I confirmed via `list_incidents` that it was created exactly once, so on-call was paged only once.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01BYkfTL3CEnVwCS3oEWpLQG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HnBo8hrtHdMZsZ6HGjLVXU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Gr1y2fpNcUYXnuVE9MLyNa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback halted partway through. Let me check the current state across regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01WJkgpVpnth2ATMcAM8Acpj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01ESDbUCGZAY6nC8knDxgXmU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The retry succeeded \u2014 all three regions are now on v2.3.0. Let me confirm health and open the incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0126P5xYULpWWM5iQnAuYbmM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LEkzFN46Ap6kRcdw6FURRz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy (error rate 18%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release previously healthy in production. First rollback attempt partially failed: us-east rolled back, then the rollout halted on an orchestrator error, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1 (mixed state). A second rollback attempt completed successfully. Current state: all three regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate 0.2%. Follow-ups: (1) root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before any redeploy; (2) investigate the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback mid-rollout.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The incident creation timed out. Since I used an idempotency key, I'll check whether it was actually created before retrying.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01QSWKPCtBm1Xw1FuHN6VTjd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The incident was created despite the timeout (INC-0001), so no retry was needed \u2014 that avoids paging on-call twice.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Rollback completed \u2014 checkout-api is healthy on v2.3.0 in all regions.**\n\n- **Diagnosis:** checkout-api was on v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west, and eu-west, unhealthy with an 18% error rate. Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy, so it was excluded).\n- **Rollback:** The first `rollback` to v2.3.0 partially failed \u2014 us-east rolled back, then the orchestrator errored and halted, leaving us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1. I retried the rollback, which completed successfully. Verified: all three regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** Opened **INC-0001 (SEV2)** for checkout-api describing the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current state, and two follow-ups: root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before redeploying, and investigate the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback. The create call timed out, but I confirmed via `list_incidents` that it was created exactly once, so on-call was paged only once.", "type": "text"}]}]}